<title>BAHRAIN: National Bank of Bahrain Q1 net edges up.</title>
<headline>National Bank of Bahrain Q1 net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit		4.41    vs   4.19</p>
<p> Operating income	7.31    vs   7.46</p>
<p> Operating expenses    2.87    vs   2.69</p>
<p> Net interest income   4.59    vs   4.47</p>
<p> Other income	    2.72    vs   2.99</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  97.22    vs  94.18</p>
<p> Assets		  764.68    vs 808.12</p>
<p>Full name: National Bank of Bahrain</p>
<p>Note - The bank is the largest commercial bank on the island.</p>
</text>
